flowchart LR
    PPO["PPO policy\nDelta EE command"]
    JEFF["Empirical J_eff\nmeasured through deployment"]
    DES["Cylinder-space\ndesired motion"]
    IDFD["ID/FD horizon rollout\nID valve estimate + FD motion"]
    TARGETS["Cylinder position targets\nsmooth horizon ramp"]
    PID["explicit_effort_pid_bias\ncalibrated effort PID"]
    PHYSX["PhysX articulation"]
    EE["EE/tool motion\ntracking reward + safety logs"]

    PPO --> JEFF
    JEFF --> DES
    DES --> IDFD
    IDFD --> TARGETS
    TARGETS --> PID
    PID --> PHYSX
    PHYSX --> EE
    EE -. observation/reward .-> PPO
